518 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Dr\056 Sree Ranga is an experienced and passionate medical educator with extensive experience in teaching and mentoring undergraduate and postgraduate medical students\054 cardiology trainees and young physicians\056 As a Professor of Cardiology\054 he has been actively involved in clinical teaching\054 bedside training\054 procedural education\054 academic discussions and postgraduate mentorship\056\015\n\015\nKnown for his clear teaching style\054 strong clinical reasoning and ability to translate complex cardiovascular concepts into practical clinical knowledge\054 he has played an important role in training and mentoring the next generation of doctors and cardiologists\056 His teaching philosophy emphasizes not only knowledge and technical skills\054 but also sound clinical judgment\054 ethical practice and compassionate patient care\056\015\n\015\nWhy Choose Dr\056 Sree Ranga\077\015\n\015\n\052 20\054000\053 Cardiac \046 Vascular Procedures\015\n\052 2\054000\053 Procedures in the Last 2 Years\015\n\052 Extensive Complex Interventional Cardiology Experience\015\n\052 Advanced Expertise in Rotablation\054 Orbital Atherectomy\054 Laser \046 IVL\015\n\052 Structural Heart \046 TAVR\057TAVI Expertise\015\n\052 Pacemaker\054 ICD \046 CRT Expertise\015\n\052 Peripheral Vascular Interventions\015\n\052 Professor \046 Experienced Medical Educator\015\n\052 Dedicated Mentor to Young Doctors \046 Cardiologists\015\n\052 Patient\055Centred\054 Evidence\055Based Care\015\n\015\nAnd I particularly like this sentence for your profile\072\015\n\015\n\034A clinician\054 interventionalist and educator\054 Dr\056 Sree Ranga combines extensive procedural experience with a passion for teaching\054 mentorship and the continuous advancement of cardiovascular care\056\035)
     /K [ 2 ]
     /P 519 0 R
     /Pg 514 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

