524 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Dr\056 Sree Ranga P\056C\056\015\n\015\nSenior Interventional Cardiologist \046 Professor of Cardiology\015\n\015\nBangalore Medical College \046 Research Institute \050BMCRI\051\015\nFormerly associated with Sri Jayadeva Institute of Cardiovascular Sciences \046 Research\015\n\015\nDedicated to Excellence in Comprehensive Heart Care\015\n\015\nDr\056 Sree Ranga P\056C\056 is a Senior Interventional Cardiologist and Professor of Cardiology with extensive academic\054 clinical and procedural expertise spanning complex coronary interventions\054 structural and valvular heart disease\054 cardiac rhythm management and peripheral vascular interventions\056\015\n\015\nOver a distinguished career in cardiovascular medicine\054 he has personally performed more than 20\054000 diagnostic and interventional cardiac and vascular procedures\056 In the past two years alone\054 he has performed more than 2\054000 cardiovascular procedures\054 reflecting his continuing high\055volume experience in advanced interventional cardiology\056 His practice combines procedural expertise\054 modern technology and evidence\055based clinical decision\055making with a strong commitment to individualized\054 patient\055centred care\056\015\n\015\nKey Clinical \046 Procedural Expertise\015\n\015\n\052 Complex Coronary Interventions\072 Left main PCI\054 bifurcation stenting\054 chronic total occlusion \050CTO\051 angioplasty and complex multivessel coronary interventions\056\015\n\052 Advanced Treatment of Calcified Coronary Arteries\072 Extensive experience with Rotational Atherectomy \050Rotablation\051\054 Orbital Atherectomy\054 Laser Atherectomy and Intravascular Lithotripsy \050IVL\051 for heavily calcified and complex coronary lesions\056\015\n\052 Structural \046 Valvular Heart Interventions\072 TAVR\057TAVI\054 balloon valvuloplasty and catheter\055based interventions for structural heart defects and valvular heart disease\056\015\n\052 Cardiac Rhythm Management\072 Implantation and management of permanent pacemakers\054 ICDs and CRT devices\054 including single\055 and dual\055chamber systems\056\015\n\052 Peripheral Vascular Interventions\072 Angioplasty and stenting for peripheral arterial and vascular diseases\054 including complex peripheral vascular lesions\056\015\n\052 Advanced Interventional Cardiology\072 Comprehensive catheter\055based management of patients with complex\054 high\055risk and challenging cardiovascular disease\056\015\n\015\nAcademic \046 Institutional Experience\015\n\015\nBangalore Medical College \046 Research Institute \050BMCRI\051\015\nProfessor of Cardiology\054 with involvement in tertiary cardiovascular care\054 advanced interventions\054 postgraduate teaching and academic training\056\015\n\015\nSri Jayadeva Institute of Cardiovascular Sciences \046 Research\015\nPreviously associated with one of India\031s leading dedicated cardiovascular institutions\054 gaining extensive experience in complex cardiovascular disease and advanced interventional procedures\056\015\n\015\nOur Care Philosophy\015\n\015\n\034Every patient deserves a thorough diagnosis\054 transparent communication and an individualized treatment plan tailored to their long\055term well\055being\056\035\015\n\015\nCardiovascular wellness is not simply about performing a procedure\056 It begins with prevention\054 early detection\054 accurate diagnosis and appropriate risk assessment\054 followed by the right treatment at the right time\056\015\n\015\nDr\056 Sree Ranga brings together academic excellence\054 extensive procedural experience and advanced interventional expertise\054 while maintaining a compassionate and accessible approach to patient care\056\015)
     /K [ 0 ]
     /P 523 0 R
     /Pg 514 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

